  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Enabling Environment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Ambiente favor&#xe1;vel &#xe0; agricultura</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Apoiar pol&#xed;ticas, leis e regulamentos agr&#xed;colas e institui&#xe7;&#xf5;es que: promovam a adop&#xe7;&#xe3;o de tecnologias melhoradas; promover o investimento em infra-estruturas a todos os n&#xed;veis e melhorar a base de recursos naturais de forma a responder &#xe0;s necessidades dos homens e mulheres produtores.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support agricultural policies, laws and regulations, and institutions that: foster adoption of improved technology; promote investment in infrastructure at all levels, and enhance the natural resource base in ways that respond to the needs of men and women producers.</narrative>
  </description>
